    "body": "Per https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors/#type-selector @gsnedders is correct. It seems like we should write something like \"ASCII lowercase type selector's identifier\".\r\n\r\nNot sure what to write for attribute selectors though.\r\n\r\ncc @tabatkins @fantasai ",
