    "body": "So https://drafts.csswg.org/css-namespaces-3/#css-qualified-name makes me think we want \"the CSS element type selector's local name must first be converted to ASCII lowercase\", though the definition of local name (and namespace prefix) isn't defined as a term in Namespaces.",
